# Knowledge Base

Mars Harness has documented standards, architectural decisions, and reference material. Before making non-trivial changes, read the relevant docs.

## Mandatory reading

- `AGENTS.md` — Project guide, directory structure, key constraints
- `ARCHITECTURE.md` — System architecture, component responsibilities, data flow

## Architectural decisions (`docs/design-docs/`)

Read the index at `docs/design-docs/index.md` to find relevant decisions. Key routing:

| When working on... | Read |
