| Agent runtime, conversation loop, tool calling | `agent-runtime.md` |
| Local models, GPU detection, llama.cpp, model download | `local-inference.md` |
| Accuracy scores, outcome tracking, progressive autonomy | `scoring-system.md` |
| Self-improvement, intervention detection, evolution PRs | `self-improvement.md` |
| Guardrails, validation, overrides | `guardrails.md` |
| Job queue, scheduler, sandbox, blast radius | `pipeline-engine.md` |
| Dashboard, htmx, Chart.js, SSE | `dashboard.md` |
| Context assembly, budgets, knowledge routes | `context-efficiency.md` |
| Product vision, tenets, Mars relationship | `docs/product-specs/` |
| Model benchmarks, hardware profiles, tool calling bugs | `docs/references/model-landscape-april-2026.md` |

